OL,3,GNEWSAShankly family welcome Anfield
OL,4,Asign's return
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of legendary Liverpool
OL,7,Fmanager Bill Shankly has welcomed the
OL,8,Freturn of his iconic 'This Is Anfield'
OL,9,Fsign to the city.
OL,11,FThe sign, which hung above the tunnel
OL,12,Fat the stadium, was bought at auction
OL,13,Fin September, bringing it back to
OL,14,FLiverpool after 20 years on the Isle of
OL,15,FMan.
OL,17,FIts wording was chosen in 1972 by
OL,18,FShankly, who rejected the original idea
OL,19,Fof 'Welcome To Anfield' as being too
OL,20,Ffriendly to rival players.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
