OL,3,GNEWSAShankly family welcome Anfield
OL,4,Asign's return
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is now on display at the ARC Hotel
OL,7,Fin Anfield, in the shadow of Liverpool
OL,8,FFC's home ground. Shankly's
OL,9,Fgranddaughter Karen Gill said seeing
OL,10,Fthe sign back in Anfield made her
OL,11,F"proud".
